 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "再看以太坊这样的 PoS 链。",
   "spoken": "再看以太坊这样的 PoS 链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.826
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "它要求三分之二的质押投票，才能让一个检查点最终确定。",
   "spoken": "它要求三分之二的质押投票，才能让一个检查点最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 4.22,
   "speechEnd": 8.878
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "最终确定以后，区块不能回滚，除非三分之一的质押被罚没。",
   "spoken": "最终确定以后，区块不能回滚，除非三分之一的质押被罚没。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.32,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 9.32,
   "speechEnd": 14.05
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "bug 让大量验证者掉线，链继续出块，但检查点不再最终确定。",
   "spoken": "bug 让大量验证者掉线，链继续出块，但检查点不再最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 14.5,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 14.601,
   "speechEnd": 19.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "某个客户端占比超过三分之一，它的 bug 就能让最终性停下。",
   "spoken": "某个客户端占比超过三分之一，它的 bug 就能让最终性停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 20.32,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 20.421,
   "speechEnd": 24.919
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "超过三分之二，它的 bug 可能把错误的链最终确定。",
   "spoken": "超过三分之二，它的 bug 可能把错误的链最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 25.34,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 25.34,
   "speechEnd": 30.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "所以客户端多样性，也是共识安全的一部分。",
   "spoken": "所以客户端多样性，也是共识安全的一部分。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 30.52,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 30.52,
   "speechEnd": 33.935
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "2023 年 5 月，Prysm 和 Teku 处理旧投票时负载过高。",
   "spoken": "2023 年 5 月，Prysm 和 Teku 楚理旧投票时负载过高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 34.34,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 34.447,
   "speechEnd": 39.216
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "主网先后约 25 分钟和约 1 小时，没有最终确定。",
   "spoken": "主网先后约 25 分钟和约 1 小时，没有最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 39.68,
   "dur": 4.48,
   "speechStart": 39.772,
   "speechEnd": 43.956
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "Lighthouse 没受影响，这次没有资金损失。",
   "spoken": "Lighthouse 没受影响，这次没有资金损失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 44.38,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 44.482,
   "speechEnd": 47.34
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "按攻击者的质押份额看，有四条线。",
   "spoken": "按攻击者的质押份额看，有四条线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 47.8,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 47.899,
   "speechEnd": 50.806
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "约 33%，能阻止最终性，代价是不活跃惩罚，逐步削减他的质押。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 33，能阻止最终性，代价是不活跃惩罚，逐步削减他的质押。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 51.22,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 51.313,
   "speechEnd": 57.957
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "约 34%，在能控制消息时序时，造成双重最终性，会被最大比例罚没。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 34，在能控制消息时序时，造成双虫最终性，会被最大比例罚没。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 58.4,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 58.494,
   "speechEnd": 65.563
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "约 51%，能主导分叉选择，审查交易，做短程重组。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 51，能主导分叉选择，审查交易，做短程虫组。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 65.98,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 66.073,
   "speechEnd": 71.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "约 66%，能在没有诚实方配合时，最终确定自己的链，只能靠社会层恢复。",
   "spoken": "约百分之 66，能在没有诚实方配合时，最终确定自己的链，只能靠社会层恢复。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 71.56,
   "dur": 7.68,
   "speechStart": 71.661,
   "speechEnd": 78.992
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "另一种攻击，用的是旧私钥。",
   "spoken": "另一种攻击，用的是旧私钥。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 79.46,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 79.553,
   "speechEnd": 81.792
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "已经退出的验证者，取回了质押，不会再被罚没。",
   "spoken": "已经退出的验证者，取回了质押，不会再被罚没。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 82.24,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 82.339,
   "speechEnd": 86.276
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "攻击者买下他们的旧私钥，从很久以前分叉，改写一段历史。",
   "spoken": "攻击者买下他们的旧私钥，从很久以前分叉，改写一段历史。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 86.7,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 86.795,
   "speechEnd": 92.477
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "一直在线的节点不会接受，它不回滚已经最终确定的区块。",
   "spoken": "一直在线的节点不会接受，它不回滚已经最终确定的区块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 92.92,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 93.013,
   "speechEnd": 97.812
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "刚安装的新节点，要从一个可信的近期检查点开始同步。",
   "spoken": "刚安装的新节点，要从一个可信的近期检查点开始同步。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 98.26,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 98.358,
   "speechEnd": 102.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-20",
   "text": "这叫弱主观性，检查点的来源，就是新节点的信任入口。",
   "spoken": "这叫弱主观性，检查点的来源，就是新节点的信任入口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-20.wav",
   "start": 103.44,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 103.44,
   "speechEnd": 108.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-21",
   "text": "所以检查点要取自至少两个独立来源，再做比对。",
   "spoken": "所以检查点要取自至少两个独立来源，再做比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg4-21.wav",
   "start": 108.86,
   "dur": 4.56,
